  "question": {
    "text": "For all complex numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;of the form <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;"
